Description: Ubuntu tray indicator for OpenAI Codex usage limits
 Unofficial GTK 3 AppIndicator application that reads account state and usage
 limits from the local Codex app-server and displays the remaining allowance
 in the Ubuntu GNOME top panel.
 .
 OpenAI Codex must be installed and authenticated separately.
